{"id":"wb-2-11","name":"巩县石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"巩县石窟","text":"巩县石窟位于河南省巩义市孝义镇东北九公里的寺湾村东的石窟寺内，为创建于北魏时期的石窟群。石窟寺原名希玄寺。唐宋两代称为净土寺，明代改为净土禅寺，清代改为今名。石窟群坐北向南，始凿于北魏，在东魏、西魏、北齐、唐、宋、金、明，以及清代雍正年间，该石窟群都重修过。巩县石窟的雕造以北魏为主，在北齐和唐代又进行了较多的开凿，是继龙门石窟后，北魏时期的又一佛教艺术宝库。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B7%A9%E5%8E%BF%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F","revisionId":91294957,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91294957","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5f4d25dfbe293b04423b6a3c.jpg","title":"20250614_Gongxian_Grottoes_-_Cave_1_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250614_Gongxian_Grottoes_-_Cave_1_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/20250614_Gongxian_Grottoes_-_Cave_1_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​巩县石窟第一窟","width":320,"height":213}}